<title>SWITZERLAND: Basle March inflation falls to 0.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Basle March inflation falls to 0.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Basle, Switzerland's second-biggest city, fell 0.2 pecent in March from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.6 percent, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				    Mar 1997	Feb 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.2 pct	+0.2 pct	+0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.6 pct	+0.9 pct	1.0 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  104.3	   104.5	   103.7</p>
<p>Consumer prices in Switzerland's biggest cities are an indicator of national consumer inflation data, which are expected next week. -- Zurich Newsroom, +41-10631 7340</p>
